**Subject:**
```liquid
{% if customer.first_name != blank %}{{ customer.first_name }}, {% endif %}⚡ Sale ends {{ "2026-08-25 23:59:59" | date: "%l%p", timezone: customer.timezone }}
```

**Body:**
```liquid
{% assign sale_end = "2026-08-25 23:59:59" | date: "%s" %}
{% assign now = "now" | date: "%s" %}
{% assign tz = customer.timezone | default: "America/New_York" %}

{% if now < sale_end %}
  <h1>⚡ 30% Off Everything</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 18px; color: #d32f2f;">
    Sale ends <strong>{{ sale_end | date: "%B %e at %l:%M %p %Z", timezone: tz }}</strong>
  </p>
  <a href="https://shop.example.com/sale" style="background: #d32f2f; color: white; padding: 12px 24px;">Shop the Sale</a>
{% else %}
  <h1>Sale Has Ended</h1>
  <p>Thanks for your interest! Sign up for alerts so you never miss our next sale.</p>
  <a href="https://shop.example.com/subscribe">Get Sale Alerts</a>
{% endif %}
```

The timezone conversion works with any IANA timezone string (`America/Los_Angeles`, `Europe/London`, `Asia/Tokyo`, etc.) stored in your `customer.timezone` attribute.

