```liquid
{% comment %}1. The triggering subscription's attributes (singular slug under trigger.){% endcomment %}
Plan: {{trigger.subscription.plan_name | default: "Standard"}}
Renews: {{trigger.subscription.renewal_date | date: "%B %-d, %Y" | default: "Date not set"}}

{% comment %}2. The recipient's relationship attributes to that subscription{% endcomment %}
Your status: {{customer._relationship.status | default: "active"}}
Joined: {{customer._relationship.subscribed_at | date: "%B %-d, %Y"}}

{% comment %}3. List the recipient's other active subscriptions (plural slug under objects.){% endcomment %}
{% if objects.subscriptions.size > 0 %}
  Your other subscriptions:
  {% for sub in objects.subscriptions %}
